$ perfwatch bogus
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
perfwatch: unknown command "bogus"

Usage: perfwatch <command> [flags]

Commands:
  run        sample CPU and RAM every second until interrupted
  top        rank the programs that used the most CPU and RAM
  peaks      list the peak episodes and who caused them
  version    print the perfwatch version

Run "perfwatch <command> -h" for the flags of a command.
